      "created_at": "2025-01-07T15:11:21.140Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Besides Voss, who could really hate this stranger from a strange land.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-305-creative-process-tempest-foes\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-305-creative-process-tempest-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"938C83\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-305-creative-process-tempest-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #305 - Creative Process: Tempest Foes</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's snowy and cold, but it wasn't when we recorded this! The passage of time is astounding! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:44:00 We make up a few villains, as is our way, each of a different sphere of Tempest's interest and influence. The first is one...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
