      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Personally, I just assume it's a different universe where things happened a little differently. :person_shrugging: We already have various examples of things that were different, such as earlier lesbian representation. I just chalk it up to that. :)\n[quote=\"fjur, post:5, topic:31254\"]\nPart of this may very well be because many of the Word-Man type names were already taken.\n[/quote]\nOh, 100%. And this is why I'm fine with the weird names: GTG has a lot of constraints that the actual comics did not have.",
