      "id": 261937,
      "name": "Jeysie",
      "username": "Jeysie",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-01-08T16:17:07.271Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve always viewed Sentinels as something of C&amp;A’s “fixfic” for comics and the comics industry.</p>\n<p>So I’ve always read the differences between what C&amp;A leave out or overemphasize compared to RL patterns as probably being a tell of what they love or dislike about RL comics.</p>\n<p>(Or in the case of things like the outsized presence of Hispanic/Latin America-inspired concepts, just non-comics-related creator love.)</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-01-08T16:17:07.271Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
