      "created_at": "2025-01-08T16:34:39.355Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting - I never noticed that, in part because a lot of my innner naming conventions are mutant-based, and the X-Men had a lot fewer people with “the” in the title - even their initial lineup had Beast, Cyclops, and Angel rather than The Beast, The Cyclops, or The Angel.</p>\n<p>Sentinel Comics definitely seems to primarily follow X-Men naming conventions.</p>",
