      "cooked": "<p>The bonus villain is so good!  I would love to see Tempest bring forced to call FILTER for help to get this actually dangerous alien social predator locked away.</p>\n<p>Kinda too bad for once that Trevor did his magic on Dr. Onomatopoeia’s letter, it would have been funnier if Christopher had just read “this letter must burn itself!  FWOOSH!” and just said “fwoosh” and totally deadpanned it.</p>",
